<title>AUSTRIA: Die Erste, Girocredit suspended till July 4-bourse.</title>
<headline>Die Erste, Girocredit suspended till July 4-bourse.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in shares of Die Erste Savings Bank and Girocredit have been suspended until July 4 pending an important announcement, the Vienna bourse said on Friday. -- Vienna newsroom, +431 531 53112257</p>
</text>
